"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[60214],{60214:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/888946c845b0ea36db9a05f81c6cefd9.jpg\\"\\n          title=\\"Polaris Gelato\\"\\n          cuisine=\\"Gelato\\"\\n          address=\\"145-9 Woongjin-ro, Gongju-si, Chungcheongnam-do\\"\\n          rating=3.0\\n          tags=\\"dessert\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\n\\nDuring my trip to Gongju, I used something called <mark>Gongju Pay</mark>. Wondering how to spend the remaining balance, I decided to visit a gelato shop I had scoped out beforehand.  \\nReviews praised it as a great gelato spot, so I headed over with high expectations.  \\n\\nGongju Pay worked on a system where you scan a QR code placed at each store, manually enter the amount, make the payment, and show the confirmation screen to the owner.  \\nHonestly, it was a bit inconvenient and tedious to use, but since it offered an instant 12% cashback, it proved quite useful for saving a little money throughout the trip.  \\n\\nWe ordered two single-person cups with two flavors each.  \\nFor our choices, we picked pistachio and pomegranate sorbet for one, and matcha and chestnut for the other.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nInterestingly, the owner mentioned that they could coat the pistachio with <mark>kadaif</mark>, so I got the pistachio coated in kadaif.  \\nIt was my first time having gelato coated with kadaif, and it had a unique, distinct charm.  \\nHowever, because it felt like eating a pastry or snack, it did slightly detract from the authentic texture and essence of pure gelato.  \\n\\nThe pomegranate sorbet was quite tart with a rich pomegranate flavor, which wasn\'t bad at all.  \\nThe matcha had an intense flavor, making it well worth trying for anyone who usually enjoys matcha.  \\n\\nOverall, it was a casual, easygoing gelato shop where you could enjoy simple, tasty treats without any hassle.\\n```adcard\\n```\\nAs a side note, Gongju Pay allows you to get a direct refund for any remaining balance, so there really was no need to go out of my way just to spend every last cent like this.\\n## Pictures\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/888946c845b0ea36db9a05f81c6cefd9.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Polaris Gelato\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/e00e6d36f8b236e25b5a6885eb2b0ffd.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Polaris Gelato\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/f88428a06563d48e20e93814c593c329.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Polaris Gelato\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/37f0e3042bdc731de6cdc8fb8c5f2555.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Polaris Gelato\\">\\n</pictures>"}')}}]);